{"ref":"2018.RM37.1","summary":"- O Canada - Moment of Silence - Declarations of Interest under the Municipal Conflict of Interest Act","decided":"CALL TO ORDER: 9:39 a.m. Speaker Nunziata took the Chair and called the Members to order. The meeting opened with O Canada. Monday, February 12, 2018 Members of Council observed a moment of silence and remembered Chris Stockwell. Speaker Nunziata gratefully acknowledged that City Council was meeting on the traditional territory of the Mississaugas of New Credit First Nation, the Haudenasaunee, the Huron-Wendat and home to many diverse Indigenous peoples. Speaker Nunziata advised Members of the following: This special meeting of Council is scheduled for the following purposes: 1. to consider the Executive Committee’s Report from its meeting on February 9, 2016; 2. to introduce and enact General Bills; and 3. to introduce and enact a Confirming Bill for this special meeting. Members of Council, this is a special meeting. Under Council’s Procedures, no new business items, such as Notices of Motions, may be introduced. This rule cannot be waived. I would draw to Members' attention that our next full regular meeting is scheduled for March 30th. Members may submit Notices of Motions to the City Clerk for that meeting.","motions":[{"stage":"City Council","when":"","desc":"Two-Thirds required - Extend the meeting to complete the agenda","type":"Extend the Meeting","result":"Carried, 32-9","yes":32,"no":9,"votes":[["Ana Bailão","Yes"],["Chin Lee","Yes"],["Christin Carmichael Greb","Yes"],["David Shiner","Yes"],["Frances Nunziata","Yes"],["Gary Crawford","Yes"],["Glenn De Baeremaeker","Yes"],["Gord Perks","Yes"],["James Pasternak","Yes"],["Janet Davis","Yes"],["Jaye Robinson","Yes"],["Jim Hart","Yes"],["Jim Karygiannis","Yes"],["Joe Cressy","Yes"],["Joe Mihevc","Yes"],["John Campbell","Yes"],["John Filion","Yes"],["John Tory","Yes"],["Josh Colle","Yes"],["Josh Matlow","Yes"],["Kristyn Wong-Tam","Yes"],["Lucy Troisi","Yes"],["Mary F